<section aria-labelledby="how-it-works-heading">
  <h2 id="how-it-works-heading">How it works</h2>

  <h3>1. Vault creation</h3>
  <p>Your secrets are stored locally in an encrypted vault protected by Argon2id-derived keys.</p>

  <h3>2. Adding entries</h3>
  <p>Use <code>desktop-2fa add</code> to create new TOTP entries. Secrets never leave your machine.</p>

  <h3>3. Generating codes</h3>
  <p><code>desktop-2fa code &lt;name&gt;</code> gives you a TOTP code instantly — fully offline.</p>

  <h3>4. Backup & restore</h3>
  <p>Vault backups are automatic and portable across systems.</p>
</section>